====================================================================================================
  (1) COMPUTED: 8 published a_0-Lambda coefficients as (kappa, eps_tot) on both footings.
  (2) NUMBERS: 5 candidates inside the BTFR 2 sigma band; nearest distinct rival to 1/2 is
      Verlinde 2016, a0 = cH0/6 at 0.482 (Delta = 0.018); 3 sigma separation needs 1.2% on kappa;
      today ~0.4 sigma; kappa=1/2 (Planck) and 0.461 (SH0ES) agree on a_0 to 0.2%.
  (3) HONEST SENTENCE: 5 candidates inside 2 sigma; 1/2 separated from its nearest distinct rival at
      0.4 sigma today; needs +-1.2% on kappa; degenerate with the H0 tension: YES.  CANDIDATE,
      not selected.

